We've got some new stuff on beta branch:

- changed the way map is loaded - we hope this will reduce memory usage and reduce loading times for late-game saves;
- added Bloodbath mode - look for it in Difficulty settings (localization to DE, FR and RU pending);
- added Custom language - when selected, this sets UI to English but loads all event texts from CUSTOM.txt file from StreamingAssets folder http://steamcommunity.com/app/378720/discussions/1/357284767250942322/
- fix to the log recorder which due to change in editor saved with main story module and caused random issues and corrupting some saves :( (apologies to all who got affected);
- re-balanced spawns to keep them on a bit more reasonable levels;
- fixed Research screen, where tooltips were not showing up for Crafting and Construction categories;

Please report any problems in the Bugs section.

