For those who do not play on beta branch, today's update will bring you:

- Fix for population growth; 
- "Show Equiped" toggle now saves its state and this state is shared between screens; 
- New Expedition screen now saves whatever you add there, so you can safely navigate to other panels without losing your set expedition squad. 
- Improved achievements handling; 
- Fixed a bug where Master Gatherer, Master Craftsman and Master Builder achievements did not unlock (unless you played without a single save/load)
- Fixed a bug where Research Requirement for Domination Victory was marked completed before reaching the required threshold; 
- Added new icons+descriptions for cooked food; 
- Fix for "Place to see" spawning like mad around the village; 
- Fixed a bug in Dwarf Smith quest; 
- Delayed trigger time of Striga attack event. 
- Added Expedition Preset on the Inventory screen. Pressing it saves your current Expedition setup (villagers with their equipment and cargo, including unused equipment). Loading will override anything that is currently in your right window. This preset is saved during game save. 
- Fixed a bug with duplicate resources being shown after research - quit - new game - research cycle.
- Resources on the map have fixed position from the start, so loading and researching should yield the same resource position every time now.

Have fun!

