A new set of changes:

- Showing where an event occurred (camera focus, particles, message). If nothing is marked then it is a global event that doesn't affect any specific group;
- Fix for hunting attack animation not showing;
- Turned off info about LMB & RMB on Logbook and on lists not containing usable entities;
- Fixed screen layering issue leading to not closing the correct screen in order;
